  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by SolarisMAX Gen5. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Solaris.\n\nYears of production: 2018-2019\n\nThe SolarisMAX is our flagship big wheel steel hardtail: 29er or 27.5+. Our fastest hardtail got faster: confidence inspiring, agile and fun, with a planted feel at high speed on the rocks and carve-it-up traction in the corners.\n\nThe Gen4 SolarisMAX used our radical Longshot geometry for sweet, short stem handling, and could run up to a 140mm fork for full trail-slaying potential. It had not forgotten its roots: with the minimum 120mm travel fork it was more than happy whizzing around 12 hour long distance races, scrambling up technical climbs, or off bikepacking in the wilderness. The Reynolds 853 frame has our famously subtle and traction-rich ride feel, with plenty of space for bags and bottles for long days in the saddle.\n\nFinishes: Hubble Purple, Mercury, Cosmic Black and Red Dwarf.\nSizes: Small (new for 2018), Medium, Large and XL.",
